  "privacyDescription": "Offline, on-device, and account-free.",
  "privacyBody": "• OCR runs on-device (Google ML Kit). No card image or digit ever leaves the phone.\n• No accounts, no ads, no analytics, no telemetry of any kind.\n• Card photos stay on this device; originals picked from the gallery are never modified or deleted.\n• Full voucher codes are never written to storage.\n• The optional USSD reader only sees phone/dialer windows during an app request and stores nothing.\n• Recharge and balance USSD sessions run inside the carrier network, which needs mobile signal — that session belongs to your carrier.",
